# @name: docker | Run Container with Named Volume
# @description: Runs a container with a named volume Group: Docker Volume Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {volume_name} = Name of the Docker volume | {container_path} = Path in the container | {container_name} = Name for the container | {image_name} = Docker image to run
docker run -d -v {volume_name}:{container_path} --name {container_name} {image_name}